1
00:00:00,685 --> 00:00:03,225
(Raj:)During which she defected
to North Korea.

2
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:06,110
(Howard:)Two booty calls with Leslie Winkle.

3
00:00:06,274 --> 00:00:09,154
(Raj:)For which she awarded him the nickname
Speed-of-Light Leonard.

4
00:00:10,695 --> 00:00:12,615
And a three-hour dinner with Penny.

5
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:16,580
Which would've been two and a half if they
ordered the soufflé when they sat down.

6
00:00:16,826 --> 00:00:18,576
(Howard:)Based on the geometric progression...

7
00:00:18,745 --> 00:00:22,205
(Howard:)...his relationship with Stephanie
should have ended after 20 minutes.

8
00:00:22,373 --> 00:00:23,663
(Sheldon:)Yes, I'm aware of the math.

9
00:00:23,833 --> 00:00:26,043
(Sheldon:)Y equals 27 days over 12 to the nth.

10
00:00:26,210 --> 00:00:27,790
(Sheldon:)The issue remains.

11
00:00:28,796 --> 00:00:31,386
(Sheldon:)How do we circumvent
his inevitable rejection?

12
00:00:31,549 --> 00:00:33,889
(Raj:)Well, if you want to guarantee his appeal
to Stephanie...

13
00:00:34,051 --> 00:00:37,471
(Raj:)...your best bet would be
to kill all the other men on the planet.

14
00:00:39,390 --> 00:00:42,020
(Howard:)I'll tell you what you shouldn't do.
That body spray...

15
00:00:42,185 --> 00:00:44,265
(Howard:)...where the women undress
when they smell it?

16
00:00:44,437 --> 00:00:46,567
(Howard:)That doesn't work at all.

17
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:52,190
(Howard:)No matter how much you put on.

18
00:00:53,237 --> 00:00:57,487
(Sheldon:)So that's all you've got? Apocalyptic
genocide and "Go easy on the cologne"?

19
00:00:59,243 --> 00:01:03,023
- Yes.
- Yeah.

